      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　もたせると\nこうかばつぐんの　フェアリー　わざを\nうけたとき　いりょくが　よわまる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n효과가 뛰어난 페어리 기술을\n당했을 때 위력이 약해진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie affaiblit une attaque ennemie\nsuper efficace de type Fée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item schwächt diese Beere\nsehr effektive Feen-Attacken von Angreifern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Estuche de aspecto sofisticado para llevar las\nlentes de contacto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se data a un Pokémon, indebolisce l’attacco\nsuperefficace di tipo Folletto del nemico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, this Berry will\nlessen the damage taken from one\nsupereffective Fairy-type attack.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
